\section{Producing program data}

The [[program]] exporter uses the same row shape as [[course]], but prepends a
cohort label.
That label includes the program code, the program round code, and the start
year, because round codes alone do not always distinguish cohorts clearly.
<<produce data about program specified in args>>=
data_writer = csv.writer(sys.stdout, delimiter=args.delimiter)
program_rounds = filter_program_rounds(
  ladok.program_rounds_JSON(args.program_code),
  args.rounds)

if args.header:
  data_writer.writerow(program_header())
for program_round in program_rounds:
  program = format_program_round(args.program_code, program_round)
  data = extract_data_for_program_round(ladok, program_round, args)

  for course, student, component, grade, time in data:
    data_writer.writerow(program_row(program, course, student, component,
                                     grade, time))
